/A 194 0 R
/Alt (Two images are presented. Image \(a\) shows a room with colored light projections on a wall, featuring labels: projector and lighting equipment. A sofa, bookshelf, and plant are visible. Image \(b\) displays a similar setup with labeled elements: object on a table, spectroradiometer, projector, participant in the dark holding a slider, and a sofa with a painting above it.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
endobj
21 0 obj
<<
/A 194 0 R
/Alt (Top part shows a table and eight small images labeled a to h, each displaying different texture projections on a bust silhouette. The table contains RMS, mean, and max values for each image. Bottom part features two photographs: the left one shows a bust without texture projection, and the right one shows the bust with texture 'a' projected onto it.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 16 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
endobj
22 0 obj
<<
/A 194 0 R
